{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get a free taste of the action in <strong>KINAP!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A pixel art action roguelite where you <strong>transform into the enemies you defeat</strong> to survive fast-paced and strategic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/8a82fc417f0e61a8cabe7c98b6b8c164.poster.avif?t=1752711750\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/8a82fc417f0e61a8cabe7c98b6b8c164.webm?t=1752711750\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/8a82fc417f0e61a8cabe7c98b6b8c164.mp4?t=1752711750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to <strong>survive for up to 10 minutes</strong> in a chaotic, enemy-filled arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock and transform</strong> into <strong>5 different monsters</strong>, each with unique abilities and playstyles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/4f5dd4738c689a45de59a7cc1b61547c.poster.avif?t=1752711750\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/4f5dd4738c689a45de59a7cc1b61547c.webm?t=1752711750\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/4f5dd4738c689a45de59a7cc1b61547c.mp4?t=1752711750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face relentless waves of enemies in a stylish and intense environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience smooth controls, satisfying combat, and the core mechanic of <strong>turning your enemies into weapons</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge a <strong>special miniboss</strong>, ready to push your skills to the limit!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo is a bite-sized version of the full game, designed to showcase the core gameplay and feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd01 Play it as many times as you like \u2014 experiment with new strategies and transformations every run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/ab6ebe661fdded6787cafd2ee5b64337.poster.avif?t=1752711750\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/ab6ebe661fdded6787cafd2ee5b64337.webm?t=1752711750\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/ab6ebe661fdded6787cafd2ee5b64337.mp4?t=1752711750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861990?t=1752711750","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/6bd5a6e29ee65ecc859d607676fdecfb667d47a5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752711750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/3dc4fd1255f1905dc9b216ba1d8d8e5ca1f215d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752711750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/3dc4fd1255f1905dc9b216ba1d8d8e5ca1f215d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752711750","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get a free taste of the action in <strong>KINAP!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A pixel art action roguelite where you <strong>transform into the enemies you defeat</strong> to survive fast-paced and strategic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/8a82fc417f0e61a8cabe7c98b6b8c164.poster.avif?t=1752711750\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/8a82fc417f0e61a8cabe7c98b6b8c164.webm?t=1752711750\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/8a82fc417f0e61a8cabe7c98b6b8c164.mp4?t=1752711750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to <strong>survive for up to 10 minutes</strong> in a chaotic, enemy-filled arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock and transform</strong> into <strong>5 different monsters</strong>, each with unique abilities and playstyles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/4f5dd4738c689a45de59a7cc1b61547c.poster.avif?t=1752711750\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/4f5dd4738c689a45de59a7cc1b61547c.webm?t=1752711750\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/4f5dd4738c689a45de59a7cc1b61547c.mp4?t=1752711750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face relentless waves of enemies in a stylish and intense environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience smooth controls, satisfying combat, and the core mechanic of <strong>turning your enemies into weapons</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge a <strong>special miniboss</strong>, ready to push your skills to the limit!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo is a bite-sized version of the full game, designed to showcase the core gameplay and feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd01 Play it as many times as you like \u2014 experiment with new strategies and transformations every run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/ab6ebe661fdded6787cafd2ee5b64337.poster.avif?t=1752711750\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/ab6ebe661fdded6787cafd2ee5b64337.webm?t=1752711750\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/extras/ab6ebe661fdded6787cafd2ee5b64337.mp4?t=1752711750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","developers":["Golden Adam Games"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Leonardo Minotti Fin\u00eancio ","fullgame":{"appid":"3847670","name":"Kinap"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861990/7ac21942a9fbc079fa0e6b4706e2e146fe6b9155/header.jpg?t=1752711750","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257169945,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169945